#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_db_debug.php:32
#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_wp_debug.php:32
msgid ""
"Debugging PHP code is part of any project, but WordPress comes with specific debug "
"systems designed to simplify the process as well as standardize code across the "
"core, plugins and themes.\n"
"                                                                On production "
"sites, the debug should be disabled to avoid exposing paths and other pieces of "
"information related to the site. "
msgstr ""
"Das Debuggen von PHP-Code gehört zu jedem Projekt. WordPress bietet dafür eigene "
"Debug-Systeme, die den Prozess vereinfachen und den Code im Core, in Plugins und "
"Themes standardisieren.\n"
"                                                                Auf Live-Websites "
"sollte Debugging deaktiviert sein, um das Offenlegen von Pfaden und anderen "
"sensiblen Informationen zu vermeiden."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_db_debug.php:53
