#: modules/components/general-js-combine.php:170
msgid "Remove Comments"
msgstr "Kommentare entfernen"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_remove_html_comments.php:32
#: modules/components/general-html.php:115
msgid ""
"The HTML source code usually contain many comment lines, however there is no use "
"for that, unless debugging. Remove all HTML Comments, which usually specify Plugins "
"Name and Version. Any Internet Explorer conditional tags are preserved."
msgstr ""
"Der HTML-Quellcode enthält normalerweise viele Kommentarzeilen, die jedoch keinen "
"Nutzen haben, es sei denn für Debugging-Zwecke. Entfernen Sie alle HTML-Kommentare, "
"die normalerweise Plugin-Namen und -Versionen angeben. Beliebige Internet Explorer "
"Conditional Tags bleiben erhalten."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_remove_html_comments.php:54
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The site pages still contain HTML "
"comments which may provide essential pieces of information regarding the active "
"plugins and themes."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>Die Seiten der Website enthalten "
"weiterhin HTML-Kommentare, die wesentliche Informationen über die aktiven Plugins "
"und Themes preisgeben können."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_replacements.php:30
msgid "Replacements"
msgstr "Ersetzungen"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_replacements.php:33
msgid ""
"The module implements a post-processing engine, which allows arbitrary words to be "
"replaced with custom ones. This works for all site data as HTML, Css, JavaScript "
"assets.\n"
"                                                                This is the perfect "
"tool to white-label any plugins or active code on a site, by replacing the specific "
"words (classes, tags, JavaScript variables etc).\n"
"                                                                Examples can be "
"found at <a href='https://wp-hide.com/how-to-easily-hide-elementor-page-builder/' "
"target='_blank'>How to white label Elementor</a> also <a href='https://wp-hide.com/"
"hide-your-avada-theme-avada-builder-and-fusion-core/' target='_blank'>HowHide your "
"Avada Theme, Avada Builder and Fusion core</a> this makes the plugins totally "
"unrecognizable for anonymous users.\n"
"                                                                <p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
"                                                                <p>This feature "
"integrates perfectly with any site environment, regardles of the used plugins and "
"themes. Changing any fingerprint does not break the site layout or disable any "
"existing functionality.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Das Modul implementiert eine Nachbearbeitungs-Engine, die es erlaubt, beliebige "
"Wörter durch benutzerdefinierte zu ersetzen. Dies funktioniert für alle Website-"
"Daten wie HTML, CSS und JavaScript-Assets.\n"
"                                                                Dies ist das "
"perfekte Werkzeug, um beliebige Plugins oder aktiven Code auf einer Website durch "
"White-Labeling zu verschleiern, indem bestimmte Wörter (Klassen, Tags, JavaScript-"
"Variablen etc.) ersetzt werden.\n"
"                                                                Beispiele finden "
"Sie unter <a href='https://wp-hide.com/how-to-easily-hide-elementor-page-builder/' "
"target='_blank'>How to white label Elementor</a> und <a href='https://wp-hide.com/"
"hide-your-avada-theme-avada-builder-and-fusion-core/' target='_blank'>HowHide your "
"Avada Theme, Avada Builder and Fusion core</a>. Dies macht die Plugins für anonyme "
"Benutzer völlig unerkennbar.\n"
"                                                                <p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
"                                                                <p>Diese Funktion "
"integriert sich perfekt in jede Website-Umgebung, unabhängig von den verwendeten "
"Plugins und Themes. Das Ändern von Fingerabdrücken beeinträchtigt weder das Website-"
"Layout noch deaktiviert es bestehende Funktionalitäten.</p>"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_hide_replacements.php:131
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>Your site assets still contain "
"traceable data within HTML / CSS / JavaScript. Those can be removed using the "
