#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_outdated_themes.php:32
msgid ""
"The biggest reason to keep your WordPress website up to date is Security. When you "
"do not update your WordPress themes, you create a security risk and expose your "
"site to existing vulnerabilities and imminent attacks. \n"
"                                                        The WordPress developers "
"are constantly fixing security breaches or improving security."
msgstr ""
"Der wichtigste Grund, Ihre WordPress-Website auf dem neuesten Stand zu halten, ist "
"die Sicherheit. Wenn Sie Ihre WordPress-Themes nicht aktualisieren, schaffen Sie "
"ein Sicherheitsrisiko und setzen Ihre Website bestehenden Sicherheitslücken und "
"bevorstehenden Angriffen aus.\n"
"                                                        Die WordPress-Entwickler "
"beheben ständig Sicherheitslücken oder verbessern die Sicherheit."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_outdated_themes.php:55
msgid "Found outdated themes: "
msgstr "Veraltete Themes gefunden: "

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_outdated_themes.php:76
