"p>"
msgstr ""
"<br /><p class=\"description\">Die inaktiven Themes müssen ebenfalls aktualisiert "
"werden, da sie schädliche Sicherheitslücken enthalten können, die auch dann "
"ausgenutzt werden können, wenn der Code nicht aktiv ist.</p>"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_outdated_themes.php:87
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>All themes are Up to Date."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>Alle Themes sind auf dem neuesten "
"Stand."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_allow_url_include.php:32
msgid ""
"The allow_url_include allows a developer to include a remote file using a URL "
"rather than a local file path. This technique is used to reduce the load on the "
"server. \n"
"                                                                There are many "
"servers with PHP configuration directive allow_url_include as enabled. When this "
"setting is enabled, the server’s directory allows data retrieval from remote "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"allow_url_include ermöglicht es einem Entwickler, eine Remote-Datei über eine URL "
"einzubinden anstatt über einen lokalen Dateipfad. Diese Technik wird verwendet, um "
"die Last auf dem Server zu reduzieren.\n"
"                                                                Es gibt viele "
"Server mit aktivierter PHP-Konfigurationsdirektive allow_url_include. Wenn diese "
"Einstellung aktiviert ist, erlaubt das Server-Verzeichnis das Abrufen von Daten von "
"entfernten Standorten."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_allow_url_include.php:49
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The allow_url_include is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix this "
"security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>allow_url_include = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag allow_url_include off</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within wp-config.php:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>ini_set(\"allow_url_include\", \"0\");</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>allow_url_include ist aktiviert.\n"
"                                                                        Um dieses "
"Sicherheitsproblem zu beheben, ändern Sie die php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>allow_url_include = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />oder "
"in der .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag allow_url_include off</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />oder "
"in der wp-config.php:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>ini_set(\"allow_url_include\", \"0\");</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_allow_url_include.php:67
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The allow_url_include is Off."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>allow_url_include ist deaktiviert."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_display_errors.php:32
msgid ""
"The display_error setting in PHP is used to determine whether errors should be "
"printed to the screen or not."
msgstr ""
"Die display_error-Einstellung in PHP wird verwendet, um zu bestimmen, ob Fehler auf "
"dem Bildschirm ausgegeben werden sollen oder nicht."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_display_errors.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The display_errors is ON. \n"
"                                                                        <br />To "
"fix this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>display_errors = \"off\"</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within .htaccess:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag display_errors off</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within wp-config.php:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>ini_set(\"display_errors\", \"0\");</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>display_errors ist aktiviert.\n"
"                                                                        <br />Um "
"dieses Sicherheitsproblem zu beheben, ändern Sie die php.ini:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>display_errors = \"off\"</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />oder "
"in der .htaccess:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag display_errors off</code>\n"
"                                                                        <br />oder "
"in der wp-config.php:\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>ini_set(\"display_errors\", \"0\");</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_display_errors.php:63
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The display_errors is Off."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>display_errors ist deaktiviert."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_expose.php:32
msgid ""
"When the expose_php directive is enabled, PHP includes critical pieces of "
"information within the HTTP response X-Powered-By header when a page is requested."
msgstr ""
"Wenn die expose_php-Direktive aktiviert ist, fügt PHP kritische Informationen in "
"den HTTP-Antwort-Header X-Powered-By ein, wenn eine Seite angefordert wird."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_expose.php:48
msgid ""
