#: modules/components/general-block-detectors.php:46
msgid ""
"Enhance your website's privacy and security with the Block Theme Detectors feature. "
"This tool prevents known user agents and IP addresses associated with popular theme "
"detectors from accessing your site's design and theme-related information. By doing "
"so, it keeps your creative choices private and reduces the risk of targeted attacks "
"exploiting specific theme vulnerabilities."
