#: modules/components/general-html.php:133
msgid ""
"When you minify HTML it removes the unnecessary characters and lines in the source "
"code. Indentation, comments, empty lines, etc. are not required in HTML. They just "
"make the file easier to read. Cutting out all this unnecessary stuff can shave down "
"your file size considerably. When you minify HTML code on your website, the server "
"will send a much smaller page to the client making your website load quicker."
msgstr ""
