#: modules/components/rewrite-json-rest.php:151
msgid ""
"When calling the site REST API base route ( e.g. /wp-json/ or ?rest_route=/ ) the "
"service outputs all available namespaces and routes for current site. This can be a "
"breach for the system, as outputs important information regarding certain used "
"theme and plugins. "
