msgid ""
"Block access to wp-activate.php file. Through this file new users confirms that the "
"activation key that is received in the email after signs up for a new blog, matches "
"the key for that user."
msgstr ""
"Blockiert den Zugriff auf die wp-activate.php Datei. Über diese Datei bestätigen "
