#: modules/components/rewrite-upload_path.php:70
msgid ""
"This blocks the default wp-content/plugins/ URL.<br />The functionality applies "
"only if <b>New Uploads Path</b> option is filled in."
msgstr ""
"Dies blockiert die standardmäßige wp-content/plugins/ URL.<br />Die Funktion gilt "
"nur, wenn die Option <b>Neuer Uploads-Pfad</b> ausgefüllt ist."

#: modules/components/rewrite-upload_path.php:82
#: modules/components/rewrite-upload_path.php:85
