msgstr "Alte URLs weiterleiten"

#: modules/components/rewrite-upload_path.php:83
msgid ""
"All old URLs using format /wp-content/uploads/ will be redirected to new upload "
"path."
msgstr ""
"Alle alten URLs im Format /wp-content/uploads/ werden auf den neuen Upload-Pfad "
"weitergeleitet."

#: modules/components/rewrite-upload_path.php:86
msgid ""
"If option active, all old URLs using format /wp-content/uploads/ will be redirected "
"to the new upload path.<br />The redirect type is 301 - Moved Permanently, which is "
"recommended for SEO purposes. <br />The functionality applies only if <b>New "
"Uploads Path</b> option is filled in."
msgstr ""
"Wenn die Option aktiv ist, werden alle alten URLs im Format /wp-content/uploads/ "
"auf den neuen Upload-Pfad weitergeleitet.<br />Der Weiterleitungstyp ist 301 - "
"Permanent verschoben, was für SEO-Zwecke empfohlen wird. <br />Die Funktion gilt "
"nur, wenn die Option <b>Neuer Uploads-Pfad</b> ausgefüllt ist."

#: modules/components/rewrite-wp_content_path.php:52
